        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(cron): detach session-targeted runs",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nFixes https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/98121.\n\n`current` and `session:<id>` cron jobs were using the source chat/session key as the execution session. That let scheduled work block or contaminate the live chat transcript, and related task rows could be left in awkward childless/no-handle states.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\n- Treat `isolated`, `current`, and `session:<id>` cron jobs as detached execution targets.\n- Use the selected source session only for delivery context and safe preference seeding.\n- Persist cron execution state under `cron:<jobId>` and per-run keys, not the live chat key.\n- Clean browser lifecycle state using the actual detached run session key reported by the run.\n- Keep stale childless cron task rows cancellable without falsely cancelling session-backed live/settling runs.\n- Update docs that previously described `session:<id>` cron as persistent live-session history.\n\n## User Impact\n\nScheduled jobs targeting a chat/session still deliver to the expected place, but the scheduled run no longer writes into or blocks that live conversation transcript. Cancelling old childless cron task records now clears the stale row; active session-backed cron runs still require a real runtime abort handle.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- `node scripts/run-vitest.mjs src/gateway/server-cron.test.ts src/cron/isolated-agent.session-identity.test.ts src/cron/session-target.test.ts src/cron/isolated-agent/session.test.ts src/cron/isolated-agent/run.session-key-isolation.test.ts src/tasks/task-registry.test.ts src/cron/service/timer.regression.test.ts`\n- `pnpm docs:list`\n- `git diff --check origin/main...HEAD`\n- `autoreview --mode local` clean: no accepted/actionable findings\n- Testbox: `node scripts/crabbox-wrapper.mjs run --provider blacksmith-testbox -- env OPENCLAW_CHECK_CHANGED_REMOTE_CHILD=1 OPENCLAW_CHANGED_LANES_RAW_SYNC=1 corepack pnpm check:changed`\n  - provider/id: `blacksmith-testbox` / `tbx_01kwfnm0qbvmv8ryyhp5sgyrp1`\n  - Actions: https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/actions/runs/28545450565\n",
